CREATURE QA (look at the image; every line must pass; at most 2 generations per sheet as before):
1. Sheet 1: FRONT left and BACK right, one animal each, nothing cropped; the background is flat grey with no placement rectangle, outline or floor line visible; no text.
2. NEUTRAL STAND: all four paws flat on one ground line; front legs vertical and parallel with a visible gap of background, hind legs the same; paws pointing forward; spine level; head straight along the body axis (not turned, tilted or lowered further), mouth closed; tail hanging as one simple shape; no crouch, lunge, braced or lifted leg, no leg crossed.
