# U01 Shambler A — Tripo preparation

Concept: `concept.png` (copy of `ashlar/art/map-01-concepts/monsters/U01_shambler/vA/concept_r2.png`, 2172x724: H, 3/4, LEFT, RIGHT, FRONT, BACK). Canon text: `concept_r2.prompt.txt`; checklist row U01 (Prologue: newly dead adult in shroud and grave-clothes, jaw bound with cloth, coins on both eyes, mud to the knees; slow, grabs and holds; no accent colour).

## Height and proportions (measured on the model views)
- 1H silhouette = 440 px. Figure 438-440 px = **1.00 H** (top of the hair).
